%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: DetectiveMonika_checkBrother
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We should talk to Elrindir to see if he knows anything else.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189333
    - rid: 1790118809755189339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, captain.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189342
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika and Ivar walk up to Elrindir, who appears to be in shock.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189371
    - rid: 1790118809755189372
    - rid: 1790118809755189373
    - rid: 1790118809755189374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello, I'd like to ask you a few questions, if that's alright.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189375
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know if there was anyone who hated your brother?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189376
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course not!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll admit he had a bit of a sarcastic streak, but nothing worth killing
      over...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did your brother act strangely in any way recently?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: For example, did he seem a bit paranoid, or say that he felt like someone
      was watching him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189379
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I don't think so-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189380
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, he went out on a hunt last weekend...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189381
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: But when he came back he didn't have anything to show for it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189382
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Usually he just stays out until he's got something to bring back.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you ask him why he came back early?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189383
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, but he sort of just dodged the question- said that the hunting grounds
      weren't favorable.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189384
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So it's possible that something happened while he was hunting that caused
      this murder...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe a hunting accident gone wrong, or maybe he saw something he wasn't
      supposed to...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know where he was hunting that particular day?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I think he said he was hunting near Lake Ilinalta; north of Falkreath,
      southwest of Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189390
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We'll have to look into that area after we're done here.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (Understood.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you remember anything specific from when you found the body of your
      brother; any details that stuck out?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189391
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189392
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's okay, you can take your time.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189393
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I remember telling him to wake up, thinking he was just lazy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189394
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: He didn't move so I went over to him to jostle him awake, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: The blood, the smell...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (The smell? The body isn't that old...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189395
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Could you describe the smell?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189398
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: It smelled of a sweet putrescense, with a hint of the burn of pure alcohol.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189400
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (That sounds like the smell of a deathbell, a common ingredient for poisons.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (We should talk to Arcadia at her apothecary, see if anyone's bought
      a death bell recently.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189399
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you for your time, you've been a great help.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189401
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189402
    - rid: 1790118809755189403
    - rid: 1790118809755189411
    - rid: 1790118809755189412
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
